#ROOMS

#4600
"A Secluded Grove"
"A large druid ring made of white granite dominates the center of this wooded

grove.  Soft, thick grass blankets the ground underneath towering aged trees. 

A hedge forms the boundaries of the grove, which has a octagonal shape.  The

grove is quiet, disturbed rarely by a chirping bird or a rustle of leaves,

giving the area a sense of reverence.  The only gap you can see in the hedges

is a small path that leads north.

"
"[Ahni] Maybe an enter circle acode?

"
