#4601
"A Path Through the Hedges"
"Loose sand crunches under your feet as you walk along the white sanded path. 

The thick hedges are closely trimmed on each side of the path, making a narrow

passageway.  The hedges muffle noise so that the air has an almost eerie

quality; even your own sounds make hardly any noise.  The path leads south

towards a secluded grove and north to a set of gates.

"
""
